    kg:textSpan "of a vision Transformer encoder, and a quantizer. The tokenizer rst encodes the input image to vectors. Then, the vector quantizer looks up the nearest neighbor in the codebook for each patch representation h i . Let { v 1 , v 2 , , v K } denote the codebook embeddings. For the i -th image patch, its quantized code is calculated as where j { 1 , 2 , , K } and 2 normalization is used for codebook lookup ( Yu et al. , 2021 ). The above distance is equivalent to nding codes according to cosine simi" .

