    kg:textSpan ") regarded MoCo v3 ( Chen et al. , 2021 ) as the perceptual model in VQGAN training ( Esser et al. , 2021 ), to pursue a better tokenizer for BE I T pretraining. Despite of the progress, most existing studies remain operating on low-level image pixels, this work explores how to promote masked image modeling from pixel-level to semantic-level. 5 Conclusion We proposed vector-quantized knowledge distillation (VQ-KD) to train a visual tokenizer for vision Transformer pretraining. VQ-KD discretized " .

