    kg:textSpan "mostly used Flickr images, because they tend to have fewer iconic images. This results in a collection of 328,000 images. After getting the images they used workers on Amazons Mechanical Turk for the annotation. The workers got a list with 91 categories and 11 super-categories. At rst a worker had to decide if a super-category (e.g. animal) was present or not. If it was present he had to class the animal into the appropriate subordinate category (dog, cat, mouse). This greatly reduces the time n" .

<http://example.org/kg/chunk/2301_04856_rag__chunk_062> a kg:Chunk ;
