    kg:textSpan "of the current research and where it might be heading. Some of the most outstanding outputs generated by state-of-the-art works are also presented in the chapter. The third part, Images supporting Language Models, deals with the integration of visual elements in pure textual language models. Distributional semantic models such as Word2Vec and BERT assume that the meaning of a given word or sentence can be understood by looking at how (in which context) and when the word or the sentence appear in" .

