    kg:textSpan ". Afterwards, for each target word, visual word occurrences are summed up together to obtain the occurrence counts related to the target word. These image-based semantic vectors are then transformed and collected in an image-based semantic matrix . The two matrices are then concatenated and projected into a common latent multimodal space with a singular value decomposition. Thanks to this process a textual mixed matrix and a visual mixed matrix are extracted and then combined together according " .

