    kg:textSpan "57 , 60 ] and large language models [ 5 , 17 , 30 , 42 , 47 , 56 ], there have been widespread interests in introducing multi-modal information into conversations. GPT-4 [ 31 ] and some other works [ 3 , 22 ] have extended text-based dialogue agents to support both textual Equal contribution. Corresponding author. Hongpeng Lin et al. and visual inputs. They provide surprisingly excellent results when prompted with questions related to visual content. However, current ways to ask questions about " .

