    kg:docId "2301.05880_rag" ;
    kg:inPaper <http://example.org/kg/paper/2301_05880_rag> ;
    kg:textSpan "topics with explicit guidelines. In most cases, these utterances are highly image-dependent. PhotoChat [ 53 ] simulates a conversation scenario of photo sharing. MMDD [ 18 ] and DialogCC [ 19 ] attempt to align textual dialogue datasets and image caption datasets. MMChat [ 59 ] and MMDialog [ 13 ] collect images and dialogues from social media. MMDialog may contain images in both context and responses. Compared to these works, our dialogues are based on videos containing rich temporal multi-moda" .

