    kg:textSpan "naturally occurring images, but others that are unlikely to occur in natural image sets, making it a test of generative models. For each of the 1,632 examples in P2, we generate an image with the text-to-image generation model G , and use the CLIP ViT-L [ 43 ] model to retrieve the top ranked image from CC3M [52] according to the cosine similarity of image embeddings v . We have 5 independent human annotators (details in the appendix) select which of the two images for each prompt, retrieved or " .

