    kg:textSpan "2023. 6 , 7 , 8 , 9 [102] Z. Xu, Y. Shen, and L. Huang, Multiinstruct: Improving multi-modal zero-shot learning via instruction tuning, arXiv:2212.10773 , 2022. 6 , 7 , 8 , 9 [103] P. Gao, J. Han, R. Zhang, Z. Lin, S. Geng, A. Zhou, W. Zhang, P. Lu, C. He, X. Yue et al. , Llama-adapter v2: Parameter-efficient visual instruction model, arXiv:2304.15010 , 2023. 6 , 7 , 8 , 9 [104] Z. Zhao, L. Guo, T. Yue, S. Chen, S. Shao, X. Zhu, Z. Yuan, and J. Liu, Chatbridge: Bridging modalities with large lan" .

