    kg:textSpan "you see? an image-context reasoning benchmark challenging for gpt-4v (ision), llava-1.5, and other multi-modality models, in CVPR , 2024. 9 [130] M. Maaz, H. Rasheed, S. Khan, and F. S. Khan, Video-chatgpt: Towards detailed video understanding via large vision and language models, arXiv:2306.05424 , 2023. 9 [131] M. Ning, B. Zhu, Y. Xie, B. Lin, J. Cui, L. Yuan, D. Chen, and L. Yuan, Video-bench: A comprehensive benchmark and toolkit for evaluating video-based large language models, arXiv:2311.1" .

