    kg:textSpan "a unified instruction-tuning format can be found in Appendix . One core point in reorganizing visual grounding tasks is the way of processing positions. Normally, the position of an object phrase is presented in the format of bounding box [ x min , y min , x max , y max ] . We use a natural language style to describe object positions along with the square brackets. A sample in the REC task is displayed as follows: How 3. LION In this section, we present the dual-Level vIsual knOwlEdge eNhanced m" .

