    kg:textSpan "and VQA), the other for fine-grained VL tasks (visual grounding). Compared to directly incorporating multiple adapters, the router module provides a better way to maximize the complementarity of image-level and region-level tasks. We use the standard language modeling loss in all instruction-tuning stages. In the experiments, we demonstrate that stage-wise training is superior to single-stage 4 that increasing the amount and quality of pretraining multimodal datasets can significantly improve th" .

