    kg:textSpan "of the most popular applications of multimodal learning. It addresses the challenge of translating text into images. Models such as OpenAIs DALL-E 2 [23] and Googles Imagen [51] have made significant breakthroughs in this area, attracting widespread attention. The work of these models can be the inverse process of image captioning. By providing short textual descriptions as prompts, text-to-image models can generate novel images that accurately reflect the semantics of the text. Recently, there " .

