    kg:textSpan ", 56 ]. It is believed that most the capability of the LLM is obtained from the large-scale pre-training process, which are later unlocked through instruction tuning [ 17 , 46 , 47 ]. There is a growing effort from the open-source community to build a strong base LLM [ 60 , 61 , 70 ], the conversational variants [ 15 , 59 ] and the parameter-efficient finetuned versions of large LLMs [ 42 , 69 ]. In this work, we start with the base Llama-2 model [ 61 ]. Comparison to frozen LLMs with visual exp" .

