    kg:textSpan "et al. , 2024 ). These two benchmarks aim to evaluate the understanding and reasoning capability of long-term videos, rather than exploiting the hallucination capabilities of LLMs. The detailed evaluation results are shown in Table 3 . On the Perception Test, VideoLaVIT delivers the highest zero-shot performance. Notably, it outperforms VideoChat2 ( Li et al. , 2023e ), which uses 1.9M additional instruction tuning data (including videos) Zero-Shot Video Question Answering . Table 2 compares our" .

