    kg:textSpan "inspiration from the most recent research on data synthesis (Wang et al., 2022; Wu et al., 2023), and build a dataset comprised of 108k multi-turn conversation samples with generative models. With careful curation, each synthetic conversation integrates multiple modalitiestext, speech, images, and musicin an interleaved manner. Specifically, our data synthesis process is carried out in two stages, as illustrated in Figure 3. Generation of text-based conversations incorporating multimodal element" .

