    kg:textSpan "Introduction The introduction of the attention operation and the Transformer architecture ( Vaswani et al. , 2017 ) has enabled the creation of models capable of handling various modalities on an increasingly large scale. This advancement is largely attributed to the versatility of the operator and the adaptability of the architecture. Initially, this breakthrough was leveraged for language-specific models ( Devlin et al. , 2018 ; Brown et al. , 2020 ) but quickly extended to support diverse mod" .

