    kg:docId "2402.14891_rag" ;
    kg:inPaper <http://example.org/kg/paper/2402_14891_rag> ;
    kg:textSpan "unified framework for various modality tasks, encompassing image segmentation, generation, editing, as well as video and audio generation. We employ the MoE technique to effectively handle diverse tasks. We devise a task-specific token strategy to seamlessly integrate different tasks into a unified MLLM, ensuring high models updateability and expandability for emerging tasks. We curate an interactive dataset comprising 400k instructional data, enabling LLMBind to tackle multi-turn interactive vi" .

