    kg:textSpan "frozen. not be sufficient to recognize the small referred objects in high-resolution images. Inspired by our previous findings about the visual granularity difference, we further propose to integrate the best of both global semantics and local details for more precise referring. To be more specific, after obtaining the encoded features of global image H g and local patches { H l 1 ,H l 2 ,...,H lN } , we first merge the feature maps of local patches into a large feature map following their origi" .

