    kg:textSpan "Hong et al. (2023) blurs the regions in the image which the model give attention and guide it accordingly with the residual information. Iterative Latent Variable Refinement (ILVR) Choi et al. (2021) guides the generative process with a given reference image. They also found a solution to semantic correspondance problem by providing texts with a low-resolution image. Denoising Diffusion Restoration Models (DDRM) Kawar et al. (2022) also proposes a posterior sampling method which improves the qua" .

<http://example.org/kg/chunk/2404_12382_rag__chunk_002> a kg:Chunk ;
