    kg:textSpan "initial large language model. Meanwhile, we leverage the routing annotations generated via the method proposed in Section 3.2 to choose experts and ignore representations from irrelevant ones during training. Supervised Finetuning. We utilize high-quality visual instruction tuning data that build upon LLaVA-665K [ 28 ] for finetuning. Additionally, we integrate several visual question answering datasets across various domains, such as DocVQA [ 17 ], ChartQA [ 18 ], InfographicVQA [ 67 ], AI2D [ " .

