    kg:textSpan "Certain tasks show improved performance with specific prompting methods, such as multi-image and coordinate-related tasks, as well as those involving visual referring prompts. However, most models do not 2 [TABLE id=2404.16006_p3_t1] caption: Table 1. The comparison between MMT-Bench and existing evaluation benchmarks. MMT-Bench consists of massive samples and multimodal tasks compared with other benchmarks. I, T, V, and P respectively represent image, text, video, and point cloud. columns: benc" .

