    kg:textSpan "( FR ), the performance of GeminiProVision increased from 30 . 5 to 92 . 5 when providing multiple images as visual prompts. iii) For SingleImage LVLMs, multi-image prompts also help improve the overall performance of most models, except for Monkey. To our surprise, BLIP2 achieved significant performance gain when switching to a multi-image prompt setting, especially on tasks like general action recognition ( GAR ) and video captioning ( VC ). These results highlight the potential of LVLMs to le" .

<http://example.org/kg/chunk/2405_01483_rag__chunk_012> a kg:Chunk ;
