    kg:textSpan "still a huge improvement space, even if a model is fully pre-trained on a multi-image dataset, which demonstrates the necessity of learning multi-image skills in the fine-tuning phase. Is multi-image pre-training necessary? To investigate, we design an ablation study, where one model is pre-trained on the CC3M 560K subset, which contains only image-text pairs, while the other one is pre-trained additionally on OBELICS-100K subset, which contains interleaved multi-image-text pairs. Due 9 Pretrain" .

