    kg:docId "2405.02246_rag" ;
    kg:inPaper <http://example.org/kg/paper/2405_02246_rag> ;
    kg:textSpan "tokens for each image ranging from 576 for DeepSeek-VL (Lu et al., 2024) to 2890 for SPHINX-2k (Lin et al., 2023). With the resulting sequence lengths, training is computationally costly, and in-context learning with interleaved images and texts is challenging because it requires modifications to the language models to handle very large context windows. We reduce the sequence length of each images hidden states by using a perceiver resampler (Jaegle et al., 2021; Alayrac et al., 2022; Bai et al." .

<http://example.org/kg/chunk/2405_02246_rag__chunk_007> a kg:Chunk ;
