    kg:inPaper <http://example.org/kg/paper/2405_02246_rag> ;
    kg:textSpan "pre-train Idefics2 on 3 types of data. Interleaved image-text documents We use OBELICS (Laurenon et al., 2023), an open web-scale dataset of interleaved image-text documents with 350 million images and 115 billion text tokens. As shown by the authors, the long documents of OBELICS allow for preserving the performance of the language model while learning to deal with an arbitrary number of interleaved images and texts and long context. Additionally, the authors show that interleaved image-text do" .

