    kg:textSpan "(LLM) into multimodal LLMs. Recent multimodal LLMs [ 3 , 13 , 47 ] typically integrate pre-trained vision encoders and LLMs with visual instruction tuning data to fine-tune the pre-trained LLMs, enhancing their visual understanding capabilities. To further scale up multimodal * Work done during an internship at ByteDance Inc., San Jose, CA. Correspondence to X. Wang (xinyao.wang@bytedance.com) and H. Shi. 1 The dog is engaging in the activity of surfing. Weighted-Sum LLM (dense/MoE) MLP 1 MLP 2 " .

