    kg:textSpan "et al. , 2024 , Zhao et al. , 2023b , a ]. However, most LVLM training data consists of single image-text pairs or pure-text data [ Shang et al. , 2024 , Dai et al. , 2023 , Chen et al. , 2023 ], which limits their ability to understand inputs containing multiple images. Recently, researchers have focused on training LVLMs to comprehend multiple images using interleaved image-text corpora such as MMC4 [ Zhu et al. , 2023 ] or OBELICS [ Lau- 2 renon et al. , 2023 , Lin et al. , 2024 , Laurenon et" .

