    kg:textSpan "contain rapid actions and movements that can only be fully captured with a higher frame rate. The first and last frames of the video were always selected, with the intermediary frames evenly sampled throughout the video. 4 Evaluation of Video Description Models In this section, we present DREAM-1K, a new benchmark and AutoDQ, an automatic evaluation method to comprehensive assess the quality of video description models. 4.1 DREAM-1K: A challenging video description benchmark Generating high-qual" .

<http://example.org/kg/chunk/2407_02371_rag__chunk_002> a kg:Chunk ;
