    kg:textSpan "2024). To address the second challenge, we propose a novel Multi-modal Video Diffusion Transformer (MVDiT). Unlike previous DiT architectures (Lab & etc., 2024; Ma et al., 2024a) that focus on modeling the visual content, our MVDiT features a parallel visual-text architecture to mine both structure information from visual tokens and semantic information from text tokens to improve the video quality. MVDiT extracts visual and text tokens, combines them into a multi-modal feature, and enhances tok" .

<http://example.org/kg/chunk/2407_02371_rag__chunk_008> a kg:Chunk ;
