    kg:textSpan "a combination of text, images, and instructions. Each query has 1 ground truth and 999 distractors as candidates. Visual Grounding The category is adapted from object detection tasks. The query combines an instruction (e.g., Select the portion of the image that isolates the object of the given label: red 3 [TABLE id=2410.05160_p4_t1] caption: Table 1: The statistics of MMEB: 36 datasets across 4 meta-task categories, with 20 in-distribution datasets used for training and 16 out-of-distribution d" .

<http://example.org/kg/chunk/2410_05160_rag__chunk_006> a kg:Chunk ;
