    kg:textSpan ":; hyperparameters_stage_1_stage_2_stage_3=5 row: :; hyperparameters_stage_1_stage_2_stage_3=10 [/TABLE] Stage II. We organize the data into the following categories. (1) Text-only data. We use pretraining text copus from DeepSeek-LLM [ 5 ]. (2) Interleaved image-text data. We use WikiHow [ 39 ] and WIT [ 72 ] dataset. (3) Image caption data. We use images from [ 17 , 18 , 23 , 38 , 40 , 45 , 47 , 49 , 70 ]. Among them, we employ open-source multimodal model to re-caption images in [ 17 , 40 ]. " .

<http://example.org/kg/chunk/2410_13863_rag__chunk_009> a kg:Chunk ;
