    kg:textSpan "1M steps, achieving state-of-the-art text-to-image generation performance, as discussed in the next section. 1 Since both FID and GenEval scores have lower/upper bounds, this linear relationship cannot hold indefinitely. Future work should explore the limits of this correlation. 7 0.2B 0.4B 0.7B 1.1B 3.1B 10 0.70 0.315 0.65 9 0.310 Validation Loss GenEval (overall) 0.60 0.305 8 FID 0.55 0.300 0.50 7 0.295 0.45 6 250 500 750 1000 Training Steps (K) 250 500 750 1000 Training Steps (K) 250 500 750 " .

