    kg:textSpan ", with a speed of 1.571 seconds per image per TPU (evaluated on 32 TPU v5 with a batch size of 2048). Detailed model configurations and generation speed results are included in the appendix. We hope these strong results and promising scaling behavior provide valuable insights and support for the scalability of autoregressive models in visual generative modeling. 6 D ISCUSSION In this paper, we present an empirical study on the scaling behavior of autoregressive models for text-to-image generatio" .

