    kg:textSpan "the question? True or False . We refer readers to Table 18 in Appendix for the specific prompts used in different multimodal retrieval tasks. To compute relevance scores, we apply the Softmax operation to the logits of the True and False tokens, and use the probability of the True token as the relevance score for reranking. Our preliminary study in Section 5.3.3 shows that zero-shot MLLM-based rerankers mainly improve the tasks where queries are interleaved text and images, such as composed imag" .

