    kg:textSpan "Chameleon [ 64 ] are the pioneers in exploring this approach. However, these methods involve extensive training from scratch, which makes it computationally expensive to disseminate exploration in this form. Follow-up works further introduce diffusion modeling [ 82 , 76 ] but leads to inconsistent training objectives between visual and text generation as show in Fig. 1 (b). (c) and (d) require additional semantic pretraining for image tokenizers [ 74 , 75 , 49 ], while (e) necessitates additiona" .

