    kg:textSpan "to continue pretraining our models. For all image-text pair data, we define the input format for multi-modal training data as: [bos] {text token} [boi] {image token} [eoi][eos] . Here, [bos] and [eos] are the begin-of-sequence and end-of-sequence tokens defined in the original text tokenizer. We incorporate two additional spatial tokens, [boi] and [eoi] to signify the start and end of image tokens. Furthermore, we reverse 20% of text-to-image data as captioning task to enhance the visual underst" .

