    kg:textSpan "LLMs for multimodal generation, particularly with the Transfusion recipe, without any compromise on the LLMs existing text-only capabilities. 6 7 Conclusion We present LMFusion, a framework designed to equip LLMs with multimodal generative capabilities. By using Llama-3 for text generation and integrating parallel transformer modules for image diffusion, LMFusion efficiently reuses compute invested in pretrained LLMs. LMFusions modular design enables independent developments of language and visi" .

