    kg:textSpan "MINIMA: Modality Invariant Image Matching Jiangwei Ren 1 , Xingyu Jiang 1 , Zizhuo Li 2 , Dingkang Liang 1 , Xin Zhou 1 , Xiang Bai 1 1 Huazhong University of Science and Technology, 2 Wuhan University { jwren, jiangxy998, dkliang, xbai } @hust.edu.cn arXiv:2412.19412v2 [cs.CV] 29 Mar 2025 Abstract RGB-Event MINIMA RoMa MINIMA LG 12.8 12.6 XoFTR AUC 20.4% RGB-Depth RGB-Infrared Average AUC (%) 45 MINIMA LoFTR Image matching for both cross-view and cross-modality plays a critical role in multimod" .

<http://example.org/kg/chunk/2412_19412_rag__chunk_002> a kg:Chunk ;
