    kg:inPaper <http://example.org/kg/paper/2412_19412_rag> ;
    kg:textSpan "on RGB image matching in terms of match number and downstream applications. Since these methods regard each pixel as matchable points within the coarse and fine matching stages, they commonly produce a huge computational burden. Driven by sufficient datasets, those deep methods enjoy great success in building more accurate point matches. Supported by our data engine, those advanced matching pipelines can be easily fine-tuned to multimodal cases with large enhancements. Recently, data scale-up ha" .

<http://example.org/kg/chunk/2412_19412_rag__chunk_005> a kg:Chunk ;
