    kg:textSpan "of varying scales, including LLaVA-OV-0.5B ( Li et al. , 2024 ), Aquila-VL-2B ( Gu et al. , 2024 ), and LLaVA-OV-7B ( Li et al. , 2024 ). Experimental results on MMEB demonstrate that LLaVE-0.5B achieves comparable results to that of the previous VLM2Vec (phi-3.5- V-4B). When scaled up to LLaVE-2B, the model requires only about 17 hours of training on a single machine equipped with 8 A100 GPUs (40GB) to surpass the state-of-the-art (SOTA) model MMRet- 7B, which is pretrained on 27 million image-" .

