    kg:textSpan "in Fig. 2 (bottom left). Specifically, our pipeline includes three sequential steps: (1) Data Generation . Given an image/video-question pair (or generation prompt), a VLM (or diffusion model) generates multiple candidate outputs { O 1 , O 2 , . . . , O N } . These outputs serve as the initial pool for followed preference data filtering. (2) Pair Ranking . Given N outputs, we group them into N /2 pairs and use our model to perform pairwise ranking for each pair. Then, we classify these ranked pa" .

