    kg:textSpan "multimodal retrieval, neither traditional computer vision techniques such as object detection [ 30 ] nor visual-language alignment methods like CLIP [ 27 ] can technically achieve this fine-grained visuallanguage alignment retrieval functionality. Recent advances in multimodal embedding models [ 14 , 15 , 39 , 41 ] have shown promising results on benchmarks like cross-modal retrieval [ 12 , 21 , 36 ] and fused-modal retrieval [ 4 , 17 , 23 ]. However, these benchmarks focus primarily on global i" .

