    kg:chunkId "2505.02567_rag::chunk_022" ;
    kg:docId "2505.02567_rag" ;
    kg:inPaper <http://example.org/kg/paper/2505_02567_rag> ;
    kg:textSpan "high-resolution or longsequence scenarios. Aligning pixel and semantic tokens also remains a non-trivial problem, as implicit mismatches can lead to incoherent representations or conflicting learning signals. Finally, current hybrid encoding techniques often assumes implicit alignment between the pixel and semantic tokens. However, in practice, such alignment is non-trivial. Misalignment between visual details and semantic abstraction can lead to conflicting supervision signals or incoherent rep" .

<http://example.org/kg/chunk/2505_02567_rag__chunk_024> a kg:Chunk ;
