    kg:textSpan "Chinese multimodal pre-training data, significantly contributing to the development of multimodal models targeting Chinese scenarios. LAION [240]: The LAION (Large-scale Artificial Intelligence Open Network) project provides one of the largest publicly available image-text pair datasets. For instance, LAION-5B contains nearly 6 billion image-text 1. https://commoncrawl.org pairs crawled from the web. This data is filtered using CLIP models to ensure a degree of relevance between images and texts" .

