    kg:textSpan "text, images, and video. Experimental results show that U N I T E achieves state-of-the-art performance in various tasks, and outperforms existing specialized domain-specific models in numerous scenarios. In summary, our contributions are as follows: We unveil the appropriate method for curating modality data during the process of learning unified multimodal embeddings, so as to balance the gap between the feature spaces of different modalities. We propose MAMCL to mitigate the competitive relat" .

