    kg:textSpan "are essential. This prompts a fundamental question for the future of AGI development: what architectural paradigm could define the next generation of MLLMs? To this end, discrete-space generative flow and diffusion models have gained attention as a promising alternative for generative modeling. These models have seen success in the domain of text generation [ 29 34 ], protein design [ 35 ], image synthesis [ 33 , 34 ], and code generation [ 33 , 36 ]. Unlike sequential autoregressive models, the" .

