    kg:textSpan "next-generation unified multimodal models. 3 ( FUDOKI ) is a Japanese term referring to ancient records that comprehensively document and integrate the culture, geography, and traditions of different regions. We name our model FUDOKI to highlight its unified ability to both understand and generate multimodal information, such as interpreting and generating diverse images, mirroring how the original FUDOKI integrates and presents multifaceted knowledge. 2 Generation Understanding Spatial Relation" .

