    kg:textSpan "We analyze the potential reason as follows. On the one hand, since the class token is used to predict the final output of model, training with only L patch affects the fitting on class token for prediction. On the other hand, different from patch tokens, the class token is a parametric token, whose variance among different input data is smaller than the patch tokens. Hence, training with only L cls is easy to cause overfitting and leads to performance degradation. Method OpenCLIP-g EVA-CLIP-E or" .

