    kg:textSpan "instruction tuning data by first applying instruction tuning with diverse, high-quality expert-written data, followed by additional tuning with a small amount of synthetic data. STLLaVA-Med ( Sun et al. , 2024 ) tackles data scarcity in medical question answering through a two-step strategy: training VLMs to generate and answer questions from input images, then using GPT-4o to create preference data from the generated content for alignment. BioMed-VITAL ( Cui et al. , 2024 ) addresses misalignme" .

