    kg:textSpan "as a pivot for understanding and reasoning. Language Support. Current models are predominantly unilingual, probably due to the fact that high-quality nonEnglish training corpus is scarce. Some works have been devoted to developing multilingual models so that a broader range of users can be covered. VisCPM [ 33 ] transfers model capabilities to the multilingual setting by designing a multistage training scheme. Specifically, the scheme takes English as a pivotal language, with abundant training c" .

