    kg:inPaper <http://example.org/kg/paper/2405_09818_rag> ;
    kg:textSpan "stabilizing multi-modal trainings were concurrently discovered in ( Lu et al. , 2023 ). Optimization Our training process uses the AdamW optimizer ( Loshchilov and Hutter , 2017 ), with 1 set to 0.9 and 2 to 0.95, with an = 10 5 . We use a linear warm-up of 4000 steps with an exponential decay schedule of the learning rate to 0. Additionally, we apply a weight decay of 0.1 and global gradient clipping at a threshold of 1.0. We use a dropout of 0.1 ( Srivastava et al. , 2014 ) for Chameleon-7B fo" .

