    kg:textSpan "holistic level as opposed to pixel-based representations. Similarly, geometric metadata captures the scene geometry more globally. They are extracted from surface normals and depth maps: Geometric complexity : angular variance of surface normals Occlusion score : % of occlusion edges over a fixed threshold Finally, image processing metadata contains several aspects of images such as original image height and width before cropping, which can be used as conditioning to generate higher quality imag" .

