    kg:textSpan "4 . Multimodal Understanding Benchmark. Current vision-language benchmarks evaluate various capabilities including OCR, spatial awareness, multimodal information retrieval, and reasoning skills [Wu et al., 2024a, Yu et al., 2023, Liu et al., 2023c, Chen et al., 2024a, Yue et al., 2024, Zhang et al., 2024, Wu et al., 2024b]. These benchmarks assess models through multiple-choice tasks, complex vision-language problems, and multi-image relational understanding. In the audio domain, several benchma" .

