    kg:textSpan "conduct extensive evaluations for a broad spectrum of MLLMs, including open-source video models, video-audio models, and proprietary systems. Results reveal significant limitations in current models ability to reason over omni-modal inputs in real-world contexts. Specifically, open-source video-audio models, despite processing both modalities, achieve only 25% accuracycomparable to random guessing. In contrast, proprietary models such as Gemini 1.5 Pro reach up to 48% accuracy. However, when res" .

