    kg:textSpan "word-level and timestamp-level alignment with the text. This significantly simplifies the requirements for training data and the inference process. 2.4 Designs for Streaming In the context of streaming audio and video interactions, the initial packet latency is a critical indicator of the systems streaming performance. This latency is influenced by several factors: 1) the delay caused by the processing of multimodal information inputs; 2) the latency from the moment the first text input is recei" .

