    kg:textSpan "to the robustness, the main bottleneck is that the community lacks theoretical tools to analyse the Transformer family. Recently, the common practices to analyse robustness are mainly based on experiment evaluations [ 291 ], e . g ., cross-dataset evaluations, perturbationbased evaluations. Thus, some multimodal datasets [ 130 ], [ 292 ] are proposed for evaluating the robustness. Recent attempts mainly use two straightforward methods to improve the robustness for multimodal Transformer models: " .

