    kg:textSpan "InstructBLIP [ 7 ], the authors transformed 13 visionlanguage tasks ( e.g. OCR-VQA [ 44 ]) into the instruction-following format for instruction tuning. Chen et al. [ 5 ] proposed a large-scale image-text dataset featuring 100K highly descriptive captions generated by GPT-4V and 1.2M high-quality captions generated by the proposed caption model, named ShareGPT4V. A more comprehensive survey can be found in [67]. The existing instruction tuning datasets are mainly constructed for general visual t" .

