    kg:textSpan "MLLM. 3.1. Knowledge-based Augmentation ns}},\\ \\ \\ \\ \\ underb Multimodal integration and autoregressive generation. An MLLM usually takes as input a multimodal input query, comprising both image and text, and generates a textual output in an autoregressive manner. Formally, the architecture is trained to model a probability distribution p ( w t | I, w 0 , w 1 , ..., w t 1 , ) , where denotes the parameters of the model, I represents an input image, and w 0 , .., w t 1 denotes the textual prompt." .

